  "rationale": "Entry footholds cost nothing; every other step counts as one. One shortest path is exposedApi:initialAccess -> sshKey:credentialAccess (1) -> fileServer:lateralMovement (2) -> shareMount:collection (3) -> crownData:exfiltrate (4). Fewer steps is impossible. The target's parents are shareMount, dbReplica, vaultRead and codeRepo, and none of them has an entry foothold as a direct parent. Their own parents (fileServer, backupHost, hypervisor, serviceAccount, localAdmin, secretsManager, monitoringHost, printServer) also do not hang directly off an entry foothold. So at least 4 steps are required."
